BorrowHealthFactors
├── Morpho Blue
│   ├── It uses virtual shares, rounds debt up and collateral capacity down
│   ├── It uses upstream interest previews, rejects overflow and skips absent interest
│   ├── It rejects uncreated markets and bubbles oracle and IRM failures
│   └── It returns maximum health without oracle reads when debt is zero
├── Morpho Midnight
│   ├── It sums active collateral with each asset's oracle and LLTV
│   ├── It skips inactive oracles and handles empty collateral
│   ├── It returns zero after maturity when debt remains
│   └── It returns maximum health when debt is zero, including after maturity
└── Euler EVK
    ├── It uses liquidation account liquidity and full precision
    ├── It returns maximum health for zero liability
    └── It bubbles invalid controller or oracle errors
